# Byte-exact dataset snapshot. data/vbo is bound to SHA-256 and Git blob
# evidence (data/vbo/committed-snapshot-evidence.json, audited by
# scripts/data/vbo-committed-snapshot-audit.mjs), and scripts/ingest_vbo.ts
# derives the dataset checksum from the working copy. Git must never convert
# line endings here: under core.autocrlf a Windows checkout would hold CRLF
# bytes that match neither the evidence nor the upstream commit.
data/vbo/** -text
